# ==============================================================================
# Secrets — this is the section §39's "no secrets are committed" rests on.
# ==============================================================================
# .env holds the API key and the database password. It is never committed, and
# .env.example (which holds no real values) is what is.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
*.p12
*.pfx
id_rsa
id_ed25519
credentials.json
secrets/
!.github/CODEOWNERS

